  <item>
    <title>V9 纯过日子时代的演员生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae1ba85c96c8942ec13a542</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae1ba85c96c8942ec13a542</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:15:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘉宾：</span><strong><em><span>彭博</span></em></strong><span> 出道饰演《青春抛物线》男一号，他是《苍兰诀》里的澧沅仙尊，是《云襄传》里亦正亦邪的钱庄老板莫爷，是《心想事成》里的资本操盘手程亮...他的影视剧作横跨校园青春、军旅、古装、仙侠、都市职场～</span></p><p><span>本ENFP带着对演员这份职业的好奇和一颗八卦的心，跟博哥约了个下午茶，我们一起聊了聊戏里戏外的生活：</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">00:01:08</a></span></u><span>&nbsp;出道经历</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="217">00:03:37</a></span></u><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span>离大谱的八卦传闻</span></strong></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">00:12:06</a></span></u><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span>忽胖忽瘦</span></strong><span>：为角色减重15斤，开机前又要增重40斤</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">00:13:52</a></span></u><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span>不想演了</span></strong></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">00:19:39</a></span></u><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span>自我调节的人生哲学：</span></strong><span>他说的再开心，也不影响我今天要吃一口红烧肉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">00:22:05</a>&nbsp;从16楼往下跳悟到的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1393">00:23:13</a>&nbsp;你明白了自由不是放任自流～</span></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1718">00:28:38</a></span></u><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span>狠角色的拍摄细节</span></strong></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">00:33:08</a></span></u><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span>啥时候发现自己有表演天赋的？</span></strong></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2702">00:45:02</a></span></u><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span>过日子的你我，</span></strong><span>进组</span><strong><span>福利：免费理发</span></strong></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2996">00:49:56</a></span></u><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><em><span>酒肉朋友</span></em></strong></p><p><u><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3098">00:51:38</a></span></u><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span>把人生的事故变成故事～</span></strong></p><p><span>访谈主播&amp;后期剪辑：</span><strong><em><span>Vicky</span></em></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65603e2e33c47d1ed09baab4/luoxucpTUBceZfmwApS2bYgDrbGQ.m4a" length="66222597" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:14</itunes:duration>
