  <item>
    <title>V8 答案在路上</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69fb74351b7bd502959d28b0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69fb74351b7bd502959d28b0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 May 2026 19:49:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>嘉宾：刘三多，离职大厂百万年薪，1人1包流浪地球1年～</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">00:03:21</a>面对最大的不敢离职</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">00:05:56</a> 从不服输的笨小孩到想做“无用”之人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="481">00:08:01</a>小学一年级，问了老师一个不合时宜的问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">00:09:52</a> 特别想要去讨好外界，因为也希望被大家所接受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="827">00:13:47</a> 大学来了一股勇气，问了公益人一个问题，干成了一件挺牛的事儿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">00:18:55</a> 学建筑的我毕业却选择去了互联网行业工作</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1456">00:24:16</a> 在重启人生沙盘里，遇到了一个契机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">00:28:22</a> 面对不敢的解药，就是听到内心真实的声音</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">00:36:51</a> 应该是头脑最大的暴政</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2639">00:43:59</a> 如何听见自己的心声？--要先听</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2961">00:49:21</a> 如何听见自己的心声？--积累数据</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3777">01:02:57</a> 路上自有答案，预留20%的损失基金</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4247">01:10:47</a>当下生出的智慧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4520">01:15:20</a> 打开自己，敢于去表达</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4930">01:22:10</a> 在奥兰多偶遇人类学家，揭示人生的意义：就是活着</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5736">01:35:36</a> 去掉“应该”的制约</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5730">01:35:30</a> 彩蛋～</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65603e2e33c47d1ed09baab4/lmV5snhdOdIEoMbXaq-yjQ2SN68B.m4a" length="97638412" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:40:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmVlhuEPxefV6GZ88jo_TqSP80sj.JPG"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
