  <item>
    <title>V6 怎么重新把自己养育一遍？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665c760694977a26efa9bd25</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665c760694977a26efa9bd25</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Jun 2024 13:39:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>很多大人们内心其实都有个小孩儿，无论我们有着怎样的原生家庭和童年，都让我们好好去陪伴这个内在小孩，安抚那份委屈，那么让我们与Ta对话，安抚Ta，重新把Ta好好养育一遍～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:13</a> 你好 亲爱的</span><em><span>内在小孩儿</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> “偷钱”小孩儿被妈妈好好托举，没有委屈和哭泣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">06:09</a> 一个女孩儿转变的故事：从走进婚姻说起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> 跳脱规训跟自己稳稳的站在一起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> 开始自我对话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 人生最大的差评师现在竟然是自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1927">32:07</a> </span><em><span>I see you </span></em><em><strong><span>我清楚的看见了你</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a> 拿回我们人生的主动权</span></p><span></span><p><span>学会自我对话，重新把自己好好养育一遍，祝我们都能开心的像个孩子！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj6eiG8hryJ5HAczmeqTRM-NGUFb.m4a" length="33172180" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvqJktFD2DZN6RDNiGIWmsZDyTCw.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>V3 板板正正的教育里咋活出洒脱自在的人生？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65901e816396a4645a5a1dae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65901e816396a4645a5a1dae</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Dec 2023 13:43:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 在有风的地方喝点茶儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 去浪陆冲咖啡店是这么冒出来的呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a>辞去国外大学教职，回国创业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">05:17</a>板板正正严肃的家庭教育环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a>妈妈在复印店里结识了画家伯乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a>好美妙的生命力， 没有那么多的情绪负担和顾虑，不会内耗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a>哈哈哈，路过一位帅气的摩托男子～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">20:17</a>呵呵呵，一位躲在树后白白的小听众～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a>这就是生活嘛，吃好喝好，新年快乐！</span></p>]]></description>
