  <item>
    <title>V2 你敢Say Yes吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6570a054f6f2b065f0c1a97a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6570a054f6f2b065f0c1a97a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Dec 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人生从来无法按照一个写好的剧本去演绎，每一分每一秒和每一个人，都要即兴地去应对～</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目我们一起聊聊：</span><em><strong><span>即兴的魅力</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv5cV3aJ4IBK32kAlBcKLkEtAmSR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a>我是在斯坦福接触到即兴的，斯坦福有两门爆款课：D.School的设计人生和艺术学院的即兴表演～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">03:11</a>Yes，and～Say yes to life</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a>即兴带给我的改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a>我是怎么带大家一起即兴的？让“好学生”跳出那个常规的条条框框和生活的规规矩矩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a>营造高能量场域 传递能量 让能量流动起来～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a>在这么好大学怎么就那么放肆的玩？跳进喷泉里玩水 Work hard play harder</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1166">19:26</a>设计和引导即兴活动的3个层次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a>即兴，唤醒、激发、解放天性、释放压力 ，既然生活无法按照计划的剧本演绎，那不如像个孩子一样玩耍吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1802">30:02</a>我看到在即兴中同学们发生的改变，打开了新世界的大门～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2196">36:36</a> 送你一个即兴的小礼物 Hooray！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltQc9tNy9WnG-ZO8YMeKVC5qm-vj.m4a" length="39193300" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZwQVI3ME5CQU1BQk9FWk1IUG5JV1F0STdJdkkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
